    "narrative": "Germany scores as a strong but disciplined expansion market for Harborstack: low geographic and administrative distance within the EU, solid technological fit with SAP-centric retail, and clear product\u2013problem match around inventory efficiency. Soft retail CapEx and works-council/legal friction pull the composite below a slam-dunk threshold, pointing to a measured Germany-first DACH entry rather than a land-grab."
  },
